{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:85ffbe85f7fc923b","name":"Gelnar Tol","source":{"id":"source:reference-85ffbe85f7fc923b","title":"Gelnar Tol","revision":24003,"timestamp":"2024-10-10T23:29:54Z","sha256":"baf2476a6f59eafe9b8d2efbdcd33ae7db060f23940a75b1f78bfc575b4ab07f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24003","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gelnar%20Tol&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-85ffbe85f7fc923b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Core of Corruption"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Core_of_Corruption","referenceId":"reference:16e354d31389fcca"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["As you enter the dimly lit metal cell, a beaten and depressed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duros"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duros","referenceId":"reference:a756a4ab3711a651"}," slowly raises his head from the cold metal slab that serves as a bed. It takes a moment for him to focus, but when he realizes that you are not a guard or Imperial, he immediately jumps to his feet. \"Please, you must get me out of here. They are monsters without pity or compassion. I surely won't last another week here. We must escape before they return to deal with you... and us.\""]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duros"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duros","referenceId":"reference:a756a4ab3711a651"}," is named Gelnar Tol, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," designer who used to work for Kuat before being abducted and brought here about a week ago. He is willing and able to tell what he knows about the Sarlacc Project (although he doesn't know the project codename or the names of the other designers). This is the heart of the design team for a massive new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," some 12 kilometers long that will dwarf even an ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Imperial"]},"-Class Star Destroyer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial-Class_Star_Destroyer"}," (and is a forerunner of the eventual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Super Star Destroyer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Super_Star_Destroyer"},"). However, the project is operating in a manner beyond belief. The designers are held prisoner by the Inquisitors, who use \"what must be evil Dark Side powers\" to rip data from the designers' minds or to turn them into single-minded machines that work on command, unaware of anything else. Gelnar Tol has no idea why the Empire would design a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," in this manner, but he is desperate to escape.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Gelnar Tol Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duros"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duros","referenceId":"reference:a756a4ab3711a651"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +1; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +7\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Bocce, Durese, High Galactic, 1 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wi